(* Safety of fp_mont_ctx_export (src/amd64/ref/fp_mont_ctx_export@2n.jinc): the lemmas of the
   specifications of theories/Fp_mont_ctx_export_safety_xtr.eca, for any operations meeting their
   contracts (declared axioms of the section), which do not use the memory: the regions the pointers
   designate are valid, the stack copies are initialised by the loads. *)
